      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FILES:\n  Scraping/src/scraper.py\n  Scraping/src/parser.py  (flatten_anime)\n  Scraping/src/api_client.py\n\nRATE LIMITING:\n  1.0 s delay between pages\n  5 retries on HTTP 429\n  page_size = 50 anime / request\n\nFLATTENING LOGIC (parser.py):\n  title{} \u2192 title_romaji, title_english,\n            title_native\n  startDate/endDate \u2192 YYYY-MM-DD string\n  genres[]   \u2192 pipe-joined string\n  tags[]     \u2192 pipe-joined names (rank dropped)\n  studios{nodes[]} \u2192 pipe-joined names\n  description \u2192 strip HTML (<br/> \u2192 space,\n                html.unescape, collapse ws)\n  coverImage{large} \u2192 cover_image URL\n\nRESULT: 22,234 rows \u00d7 25 columns",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FILES:\n  Scraping/src/scraper.py\n  Scraping/src/parser.py  (flatten_anime)\n  Scraping/src/api_client.py\n\nRATE LIMITING:\n  1.0 s delay between pages\n  5 retries on HTTP 429\n  page_size = 50 anime / request\n\nFLATTENING LOGIC (parser.py):\n  title{} \u2192 title_romaji, title_english,\n            title_native\n  startDate/endDate \u2192 YYYY-MM-DD string\n  genres[]   \u2192 pipe-joined string\n  tags[]     \u2192 pipe-joined names (rank dropped)\n  studios{nodes[]} \u2192 pipe-joined names\n  description \u2192 strip HTML (<br/> \u2192 space,\n                html.unescape, collapse ws)\n  coverImage{large} \u2192 cover_image URL\n\nRESULT: 22,234 rows \u00d7 25 columns",
      "autoResize": false,
