      "text": "INPUT: Scraping/data/raw/anime_full.csv\n\nFIELDS USED:\n  id \u00b7 title_romaji \u00b7 genres \u00b7 tags\n  studios \u00b7 description \u00b7 popularity\n\nSEED SELECTION:\n  100 most-popular anime (by popularity col)\n\nCANDIDATE POOL per seed  (~40 entries):\n  thematic_overlap  \u2013 same genre/tag cluster\n  same_franchise    \u2013 sequel / prequel\n  direct_franchise  \u2013 continuation / spin-off\n  dissimilar        \u2013 deliberate negatives\n\nOUTPUT COLUMNS (recommendation_candidates.csv):\n  seed_id \u00b7 seed_title\n  seed_genres \u00b7 seed_tags \u00b7 seed_description\n  candidate_id \u00b7 candidate_title\n  candidate_genres \u00b7 candidate_tags\n  candidate_description \u00b7 candidate_source",
      "textAlign": "left",
