      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "MODEL: GPT-OSS 120B via OpenAI-compatible API\n\nFIELDS SENT TO LLM per request:\n  seed: id, title, genres (comma), tags,\n        description (truncated)\n  candidates[]: id, title, genres, tags,\n                description (truncated)\n\n3-PASS AGENTIC PIPELINE:\n  Pass 1 \u2014 GPT-OSS ranking agent:\n    Selects top 15 from ~40 candidates\n    Assigns rank, label (0/1/2), score, reason\n  Pass 2 \u2014 GPT-OSS verifier:\n    Checks reasoning, calibration,\n    label\u2194score consistency, rank order\n  Pass 3 \u2014 GPT-OSS verifier/calibrator:\n    Can rewrite, rescore, reorder, or replace\n\nFIELDS ADDED PER ROW:\n  rank \u00b7 similarity_label (0/1/2)\n  similarity_score_10 (0.0\u201310.0)\n  reason (LLM text)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MODEL: GPT-OSS 120B via OpenAI-compatible API\n\nFIELDS SENT TO LLM per request:\n  seed: id, title, genres (comma), tags,\n        description (truncated)\n  candidates[]: id, title, genres, tags,\n                description (truncated)\n\n3-PASS AGENTIC PIPELINE:\n  Pass 1 \u2014 GPT-OSS ranking agent:\n    Selects top 15 from ~40 candidates\n    Assigns rank, label (0/1/2), score, reason\n  Pass 2 \u2014 GPT-OSS verifier:\n    Checks reasoning, calibration,\n    label\u2194score consistency, rank order\n  Pass 3 \u2014 GPT-OSS verifier/calibrator:\n    Can rewrite, rescore, reorder, or replace\n\nFIELDS ADDED PER ROW:\n  rank \u00b7 similarity_label (0/1/2)\n  similarity_score_10 (0.0\u201310.0)\n  reason (LLM text)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "index": "aq"
    },
