      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FILE: Annotation/data/final_cleaned_annotated_set.csv\nROWS: 1,500  (100 seeds \u00d7 15 recs)  \u00b7  COLS: 12\n\nCOLUMNS:\n  seed_id  \u00b7  seed_title\n  rank  (1\u201315 per seed, 1 = strongest)\n  recommended_id  \u00b7  recommended_title\n  similarity_label:  0 not similar\n                     1 somewhat similar\n                     2 strong recommendation\n  similarity_score_10:  float 0.0\u201310.0\n  reason  (LLM explanation)\n  seed_genres  \u00b7  recommended_genres\n  seed_tags    \u00b7  recommended_tags\n\nLABEL DISTRIBUTION:\n  2 strong:     728 rows  (48.5%)\n  1 somewhat:   734 rows  (48.9%)\n  0 not similar: 38 rows  (2.5%)\nBalanced positives: strong + somewhat \u2248 97.5%\n\nUSED BY: all 5 model evaluation variants",
