      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781864636937,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FILE: tfidf_recommender.py\n\nINDEX BUILD:\n  Concatenate all features \u2192 content string\n  TfidfVectorizer params:\n    max_features = 50,000\n    min_df = 2\n    ngram_range = (1, 2)\n    sublinear_tf = True\n    stop_words = 'english'\n  \u2192 TF-IDF matrix [21,901 \u00d7 50,000]\n\nQUERY:\n  Source anime vector (row from matrix)\n  Cosine similarity against all rows\n\nFIELD WEIGHTS: none (flat concat)\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (cosine 0\u20131)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FILE: tfidf_recommender.py\n\nINDEX BUILD:\n  Concatenate all features \u2192 content string\n  TfidfVectorizer params:\n    max_features = 50,000\n    min_df = 2\n    ngram_range = (1, 2)\n    sublinear_tf = True\n    stop_words = 'english'\n  \u2192 TF-IDF matrix [21,901 \u00d7 50,000]\n\nQUERY:\n  Source anime vector (row from matrix)\n  Cosine similarity against all rows\n\nFIELD WEIGHTS: none (flat concat)\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (cosine 0\u20131)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "index": "b09"
    },
