      "seed": 1954246075,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1518159812,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781863234256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FILE: bm25f_recommender.py\n\nINDEX BUILD:\n  Keeps fields SEPARATE (not concatenated)\n  Builds per-field inverted token index\n  k1 = 1.5  (term freq saturation)\n\nFIELD WEIGHTS  (w)  &  LENGTH NORMS  (b):\n  genres:      w=5.0  b=0.10\n  tags:        w=4.0  b=0.30\n  title:       w=2.0  b=0.20\n  description: w=1.0  b=0.75\n  studios:     w=0.5  b=0.20\n  format:      w=0.5  b=0.10\n  source:      w=0.5  b=0.10\n\nQUERY: source anime terms \u2192 weighted BM25F\n  scores; skip score \u2264 0\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (BM25F)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FILE: bm25f_recommender.py\n\nINDEX BUILD:\n  Keeps fields SEPARATE (not concatenated)\n  Builds per-field inverted token index\n  k1 = 1.5  (term freq saturation)\n\nFIELD WEIGHTS  (w)  &  LENGTH NORMS  (b):\n  genres:      w=5.0  b=0.10\n  tags:        w=4.0  b=0.30\n  title:       w=2.0  b=0.20\n  description: w=1.0  b=0.75\n  studios:     w=0.5  b=0.20\n  format:      w=0.5  b=0.10\n  source:      w=0.5  b=0.10\n\nQUERY: source anime terms \u2192 weighted BM25F\n  scores; skip score \u2264 0\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (BM25F)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image",
      "autoResize": false,
