      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781864714450,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FILE: embedding_recommender.py\n\nINDEX BUILD:\n  Same content string as TF-IDF\n  Model option 1: all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n  Model option 2: BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5\n  Batch size: 64\n\nCACHE  (computed once per model):\n  anime_embeddings_minilm.npy\n  anime_embeddings_bge_base.npy\n  cache metadata stores model name + text version\n\nQUERY:\n  Source anime vector vs all vectors\n  Cosine / dot-product similarity\n  BGE gives stronger retrieval embeddings\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (cosine 0\u20131)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FILE: embedding_recommender.py\n\nINDEX BUILD:\n  Same content string as TF-IDF\n  Model option 1: all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n  Model option 2: BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5\n  Batch size: 64\n\nCACHE  (computed once per model):\n  anime_embeddings_minilm.npy\n  anime_embeddings_bge_base.npy\n  cache metadata stores model name + text version\n\nQUERY:\n  Source anime vector vs all vectors\n  Cosine / dot-product similarity\n  BGE gives stronger retrieval embeddings\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (cosine 0\u20131)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image",
      "autoResize": false,
