      "seed": 514909067,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1627997636,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781863234256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FILE: hybrid_recommender.py\n\nWEIGHTED SUM OF 5 SIGNALS:\n  bm25f_score      \u00d7 0.45\n  tfidf_score      \u00d7 0.20\n  embedding_score  \u00d7 0.15\n  tag_overlap      \u00d7 0.15\n  genre_overlap    \u00d7 0.05\n\ntag/genre overlap = Jaccard similarity\n  on pipe-split sets\n\nPROCESS:\n  Run all 3 sub-recommenders\n  Normalize each score \u2192 [0, 1]\n  Compute weighted composite\n  Sort descending \u2192 top K\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (composite 0\u20131)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image\n\n\u2605 BEST MODEL across all metrics",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FILE: hybrid_recommender.py\n\nWEIGHTED SUM OF 5 SIGNALS:\n  bm25f_score      \u00d7 0.45\n  tfidf_score      \u00d7 0.20\n  embedding_score  \u00d7 0.15\n  tag_overlap      \u00d7 0.15\n  genre_overlap    \u00d7 0.05\n\ntag/genre overlap = Jaccard similarity\n  on pipe-split sets\n\nPROCESS:\n  Run all 3 sub-recommenders\n  Normalize each score \u2192 [0, 1]\n  Compute weighted composite\n  Sort descending \u2192 top K\n\nOUTPUT LIST per result:\n  id \u00b7 title \u00b7 title_english\n  score (composite 0\u20131)\n  genres \u00b7 tags \u00b7 cover_image\n\n\u2605 BEST MODEL across all metrics",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "index": "b0L"
    },
