      "seed": 40009588,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1475636292,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781863234256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "SCRIPT: evaluate_models.py / compare scripts\n\nPROCEDURE (per model):\n  1. Load anime_clean.csv \u2192 build index\n  2. For each of 100 seed anime:\n       call recommend_by_id(id, top_k=15)\n       returns: [{id, score}, ...]\n  3. Look up test set rows where\n       seed_id matches\n  4. Compute P@K, R@K, and NDCG@K\n\nSTRICT:  relevant = label == 2\nLENIENT: relevant = label >= 1\nK tested: 3, 5, 10, 15",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SCRIPT: evaluate_models.py / compare scripts\n\nPROCEDURE (per model):\n  1. Load anime_clean.csv \u2192 build index\n  2. For each of 100 seed anime:\n       call recommend_by_id(id, top_k=15)\n       returns: [{id, score}, ...]\n  3. Look up test set rows where\n       seed_id matches\n  4. Compute P@K, R@K, and NDCG@K\n\nSTRICT:  relevant = label == 2\nLENIENT: relevant = label >= 1\nK tested: 3, 5, 10, 15",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "index": "b0R"
    },
