      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "ENDPOINT: GET /api/search\n\nREQUEST PARAMS:\n  q  (str)  \u2014 title search query\n\nPROCESSING:\n  TF-IDF recommender.search_titles(q, limit=10)\n  Title substring + fuzzy match\n\nRESPONSE (JSON):\n  { \"results\": [\n      { \"id\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\" },\n      ...  (up to 10)\n  ] }\n\nUSED FOR: autocomplete dropdown in UI",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ENDPOINT: GET /api/search\n\nREQUEST PARAMS:\n  q  (str)  \u2014 title search query\n\nPROCESSING:\n  TF-IDF recommender.search_titles(q, limit=10)\n  Title substring + fuzzy match\n\nRESPONSE (JSON):\n  { \"results\": [\n      { \"id\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\" },\n      ...  (up to 10)\n  ] }\n\nUSED FOR: autocomplete dropdown in UI",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "index": "b0f"
    },
